    "text": "Origins Game Fair 2003, held at the Greater Columbus Convention Center in Columbus, Ohio, from 26 to 29 June 2003, was one of the last Pokémon events Wizards of the Coast ran, and hosted the second Professor Championship. Some attendees got a holofoil Kyogre ex, the first Nintendo Black Star Promo, from Nintendo and Pokémon USA, who had just taken the English card game over.",
